  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole adult animal with small head, slender elongated neck and markedly unequal forelimb/hindlimb lengths. Not embryo, partial skeleton or a generic heavy quadrupedal sauropod.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic whole-animal reconstruction, not fossil scan. Adult neotype BP/1/4934 preserves skull, neck, trunk and forelimb but lacks most hindlimbs and tail. Those missing regions and pose/soft tissue are inferred from adult anatomical evidence. Four metres is an approximate species-level display scale, not measured neotype total.\",\"zh\":\"完整成年活体美术复原，非化石扫描。成年新模 BP/1/4934 保留头颈躯干和前肢，但缺大部分后肢与尾；缺失部分、姿态及软组织依据成年解剖资料复原。4米为约定估算展示尺度，非新模全长实测。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":344,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Massospondylus\",\"zh\":\"大椎龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Massospondylus carinatus\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Saurischia, Sauropodomorpha, Massospondylidae\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":4.0,\"basis\":\"NHM approximate genus length; Wits reports adults up to about5m. Not exact neotype measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Small short box-like skull on a long slender neck, not hatchling oversized head.\",\"Short grasping forelimbs and distinctly longer weight-bearing hindlimbs; chosen adult bipedal stance.\",\"Full muscular tapering tail balances trunk; no short embryo tail.\",\"Neck extends gently forward, not the extreme curved burial arrangement in Figure1.\",\"Palms face inward with modest grasping digits; no forced downward pronation or columnar sauropod forefeet.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Barrett etal2019 Figure1A-B BP/1/4934 actual photographs visually inspected. Adult established by histology, incomplete hindlimbs/tail explicitly acknowledged. Wits2005 adult ontogeny summary supports long neck/small head/short forelimbs/long hindlimbs.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：{\"representation\":\"living-reconstruction\",\"scope\":\"Whole adult animal with small head, slender elongated neck and markedly unequal forelimb/hindlimb lengths. Not embryo, partial skeleton or a generic heavy quadrupedal sauropod.\",\"scientific_limits\":{\"en\":\"Artistic whole-animal reconstruction, not fossil scan. Adult neotype BP/1/4934 preserves skull, neck, trunk and forelimb but lacks most hindlimbs and tail. Those missing regions and pose/soft tissue are inferred from adult anatomical evidence. Four metres is an approximate species-level display scale, not measured neotype total.\",\"zh\":\"完整成年活体美术复原，非化石扫描。成年新模 BP/1/4934 保留头颈躯干和前肢，但缺大部分后肢与尾；缺失部分、姿态及软组织依据成年解剖资料复原。4米为约定估算展示尺度，非新模全长实测。\"},\"inventory_ordinal\":344,\"name\":{\"en\":\"Massospondylus\",\"zh\":\"大椎龙\"},\"taxon\":\"Massospondylus carinatus\",\"classification\":\"Dinosauria, Saurischia, Sauropodomorpha, Massospondylidae\",\"scale\":{\"total_length_m\":4.0,\"basis\":\"NHM approximate genus length; Wits reports adults up to about5m. Not exact neotype measurement.\"},\"diagnostic_targets\":[\"Small short box-like skull on a long slender neck, not hatchling oversized head.\",\"Short grasping forelimbs and distinctly longer weight-bearing hindlimbs; chosen adult bipedal stance.\",\"Full muscular tapering tail balances trunk; no short embryo tail.\",\"Neck extends gently forward, not the extreme curved burial arrangement in Figure1.\",\"Palms face inward with modest grasping digits; no forced downward pronation or columnar sauropod forefeet.\"],\"specimen_basis\":\"Barrett etal2019 Figure1A-B BP/1/4934 actual photographs visually inspected. Adult established by histology, incomplete hindlimbs/tail explicitly acknowledged. Wits2005 adult ontogeny summary supports long neck/small head/short forelimbs/long hindlimbs.\"}"
  },
